+# Nolane UI bridge
+
+This is a thin discovery bridge, not a second copy of NUI. The canonical bootstrap is `skills/using-nolane-ui/SKILL.md`; the canonical graph is `skills/skill-graph.json`.
+
+When a task materially designs, implements, audits, reproduces or verifies UI/UX:
+1. Read the canonical bootstrap and preserve its route, omission and evidence rules.
+2. Route through the canonical graph and load only triggered owners.
+3. External libraries, skills, images and creative tools remain bounded by NUI authority, trust and provenance contracts.
+4. This bridge, MCP transport, copied prompt or visual gallery never becomes design authority.
+5. Host permissions remain authoritative; unavailable browser/image/design-canvas capability creates evidence debt, not fabricated completion.
